    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U-Elisha wayesekhuluma kowesifazane owavusa indodana yakhe, wathi: “Suka uhambe, wena nendlu yakho, uhlale njengowezizwe lapho ungagogobala khona, ngokuba uJehova ubize indlala; futhi kuyofika phezu kwezwe iminyaka eyisikhombisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owesifazane wayeseqeda, wenza njengezwi lomuntu kaNkulunkulu; wahamba nendlu yakhe, wagogobala iminyaka eyisikhombisa ezweni lamaFilisti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ekupheleni kweminyaka eyisikhombisa owesifazane wabuya ezweni lamaFilisti, waphuma ukuyobiza inkosi ngendlu yakhe nezwe lakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yasikhuluma kuGehazi, inceku yomuntu kaNkulunkulu, yathi: Ngitshele zonke izinto ezinkulu uEliza azenzileyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esayilandisa inkosi ukuthi usisindise kanjani isidumbu, bheka, owesifazane owaphiliswa indodana yakhe wakhala enkosini ngendlu yakhe nezwe lakhe. Wayesethi uGehazi: “Nkosi yami, nkosi, ngowesifazane, nendodana yakhe ephilise u-Elisa;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yasimbuza owesifazane, wayitshela. Inkosi yammisela induna ethile, yathi: “Buyisa konke okwakhe, nezithelo zonke zensimu kusukela osukwini asuka ngalo ezweni kuze kube manje.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U-Elisha wafika eDamaseku; uBehadadi inkosi yase-Aramu wayegula; watshelwa ukuthi: “Umuntu kaNkulunkulu ufikile lapha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yasisithi kuHasayeli: Thatha isipho esandleni sakho, uyehlangabeza umuntu kaNkulunkulu, ubuze eNkosini ngaye, uthi: Ngizaphiliswa yini kulesi sifo?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHazayeli wayesehamba ukumhlangabeza, waphatha kuye isipho sakho kuzo zonke izinto ezinhle zaseDamaseku, umthwalo wamakamela angamashumi amane, weza, wema phambi kwakhe, wathi: “Indodana yakho uBenihadadi, inkosi yase-Aramu, ingilethile kuwe. Wathuma ukuthi, Ngiyakusinda yini kulesi sifo na?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U-Elisha wathi kuye: “Hamba uthi kuye: ‘Uyakuphila nokuphuluka, kepha uJehova ungibonisile ukuthi uyakufa nokufa.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waquma ubuso bakhe waze waba namahloni; umuntu kaNkulunkulu wakhala izinyembezi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHasayeli wasesithi: Inkosi yami ililelani? Wathi: “Ngokuba ngiyazi okubi oyakukwenza kubantwana bakwa-Israyeli; uyakuthungela izinqaba zabo ngomlilo, izinsizwa zabo zinibulale ngenkemba, zichoboze abantwana babo, ziklebhule abesifazane babo nengane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHasayeli wasesithi: Kodwa inceku yakho iyini, iyinja, ukuthi yenze le into enkulu? U-Elisha wathi: “UJehova wangibonisa ukuthi uyakuba yinkosi e-Aramu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayesemshiya u-Elisha, weza enkosini yakhe; bathi kuye: Wathini uElisa kuwe? Wathi: “Ungitshele ukuthi umelwe ukuphila nokusindiswa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngangomuso wathatha indwangu ewugqinsi, wayicwilisa emanzini, wayinemba ebusweni bakhe, yafa; uHasayeli waba yinkosi esikhundleni sakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngomnyaka wesihlanu kaJoramu indodana ka-Ahabi, inkosi yakwa-Israyeli, uJehoshafati eseyinkosi kwaJuda, uJoramu indodana kaJehoshafati inkosi yakwaJuda waba yinkosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
