        },
        {
          "text": "UJoramu wayesewelela eSayiri nazo zonke izinqola kanye naye; wavuka ebusuku, wabachitha abakwa-Edomi ababemhaqile, nezinduna zezinqola; amadoda abalekela ematendeni awo.",
