              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahamba ngendlela yendlu ka-Ahabi, wenza okubi emehlweni kaJehova njengendlu ka-Ahabi, ngokuba wayengumkhwenyana wendlu ka-Ahabi.",
          "type": "text",
